{"suttaId":"tha-ap486","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1982,2069],"vripara":"46"},"segments":{"tha-ap486:0.3":"Ñāṇathavikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap486:1.1":"“Dakkhiṇe himavantassa, sukato assamo mama;","tha-ap486:1.3":"Uttamatthaṃ gavesanto, vasāmi vipine tadā.","tha-ap486:2.1":"“Lābhālābhena santuṭṭho, mūlena ca phalena ca;","tha-ap486:2.3":"Anvesanto ācariyaṃ, vasāmi ekako ahaṃ.","tha-ap486:3.1":"“Sumedho nāma sambuddho, loke uppajji tāvade;","tha-ap486:3.3":"Catusaccaṃ pakāseti, uddharanto mahājanaṃ.","tha-ap486:4.1":"“Nāhaṃ suṇomi sambuddhaṃ, napi me koci saṃsati [bhāsati (sī.), sāsati (syā. pī.)];","tha-ap486:4.3":"Aṭṭhavasse atikkante, assosiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap486:5.1":"“Aggidāruṃ nīharitvā, sammajjitvāna assamaṃ;","tha-ap486:5.3":"Khāribhāraṃ gahetvāna, nikkhamiṃ vipinā ahaṃ.","tha-ap486:6.1":"“Ekarattiṃ vasantohaṃ, gāmesu nigamesu ca;","tha-ap486:6.3":"Anupubbena candavatiṃ, tadāhaṃ upasaṅkamiṃ.","tha-ap486:7.1":"“Bhagavā tamhi samaye, sumedho lokanāyako;","tha-ap486:7.3":"Uddharanto bahū satte, deseti amataṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap486:8.1":"“Janakāyamatikkamma, vanditvā jinasāgaraṃ;","tha-ap486:8.3":"Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap486:9.1":"“‘Tuvaṃ satthā ca ketu ca, dhajo yūpo ca pāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap486:9.3":"Parāyano [parāyaṇo (sī. pī.)] patiṭṭhā ca, dīpo ca dvipaduttamo.","tha-ap486:10.1":"Ekavīsatimaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","tha-ap486:11.1":"“‘Nepuñño dassane vīro, tāresi janataṃ tuvaṃ;","tha-ap486:11.3":"Natthañño tārako loke, tavuttaritaro mune.","tha-ap486:12.1":"“‘Sakkā theve [have (sī. pī.) bhave (syā. ka.)] kusaggena, pametuṃ sāgaruttame [sāgaruttamo (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap486:12.3":"Natveva tava sabbaññu, ñāṇaṃ sakkā pametave.","tha-ap486:13.1":"“‘Tuladaṇḍe [tulamaṇḍale (sī. pī.)] ṭhapetvāna, mahiṃ [mahī (syā. pī.)] sakkā dharetave;","tha-ap486:13.3":"Natveva tava paññāya, pamāṇamatthi cakkhuma.","tha-ap486:14.1":"“‘Ākāso minituṃ sakkā, rajjuyā aṅgulena vā;","tha-ap486:14.3":"Natveva tava sabbaññu, sīlaṃ sakkā pametave.","tha-ap486:15.1":"“‘Mahāsamudde udakaṃ, ākāso ca vasundharā;","tha-ap486:15.3":"Parimeyyāni etāni, appameyyosi cakkhuma’.","tha-ap486:16.1":"“Chahi gāthāhi sabbaññuṃ, kittayitvā mahāyasaṃ;","tha-ap486:16.3":"Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, tuṇhī aṭṭhāsahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap486:17.1":"“Yaṃ vadanti sumedhoti, bhūripaññaṃ sumedhasaṃ;","tha-ap486:17.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap486:18.1":"“‘Yo me ñāṇaṃ pakittesi, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap486:18.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","tha-ap486:19.1":"“‘Sattasattati kappāni, devaloke ramissati;","tha-ap486:19.3":"Sahassakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjaṃ karissati.","tha-ap486:20.1":"“‘Anekasatakkhattuñca, cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap486:20.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap486:21.1":"“‘Devabhūto manusso vā, puññakammasamāhito;","tha-ap486:21.3":"Anūnamanasaṅkappo, tikkhapañño bhavissati’.","tha-ap486:22.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap486:22.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap486:23.1":"“Agārā abhinikkhamma, pabbajissati kiñcano;","tha-ap486:23.3":"Jātiyā sattavassena, arahattaṃ phusissati.","tha-ap486:24.1":"“Yato sarāmi attānaṃ, yato pattosmi sāsanaṃ;","tha-ap486:24.3":"Etthantare na jānāmi, cetanaṃ amanoramaṃ.","tha-ap486:25.1":"“Saṃsaritvā bhave sabbe, sampattānubhaviṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap486:25.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, phalaṃ ñāṇassa thomane.","tha-ap486:26.1":"“Tiyaggī nibbutā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap486:26.3":"Sabbāsavā parikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","tha-ap486:27.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ ñāṇamathaviṃ ahaṃ [mabhithomayiṃ (sī. pī.), mabhithomahaṃ (syā.)];","tha-ap486:27.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phalaṃ ñāṇassa thomane.","tha-ap486:28.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap486:29.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap486:30.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap486:31.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ñāṇathaviko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap486:32.1":"Ñāṇathavikattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
